# Trivy: control-plane image findings left on purpose (KAN-179, docs/security/operations.md#vulnerability-management).
# One id per line, under a comment saying why. Each carries exp: its triage deadline (High 30 days, Medium 90, Low
# the next release, taken as 90), after which it is reported again. Findings with no fixed version aren't reported
# at all (--ignore-unfixed).
#
# First scan, 2026-10-26: 7 High, 12 Medium, 2 Low, none in hangar's own dependencies (uv.lock is clean). Every one
# is in a tool the image bundles, fixed only by its vendor's next release:

# docker-buildx-plugin (Docker's apt repository): 0.38.1, the latest, still vendors go-archive 0.2.0 and x/net 0.59.0
